    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίχειρ</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκτυλος,</span> which is supplied in <i><span class="en">
			Heliod.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
